{"code":"id-ID","name":"Indonesian","native":"Bahasa Indonesia","badge":"ID","tts":"id-ID","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Saya tidak mengerti.","say":"SA-ya TEE-dak meng-ER-tee","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Saya tidak tahu.","say":"SA-ya TEE-dak TA-hu","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Sebentar, ya.","say":"seh-BEN-tar, ya","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Bisa diulang?","say":"BEE-sa dee-U-lang","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Pelan-pelan, ya.","say":"peh-LAN peh-LAN, ya","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Bahasa Indonesianya “…” apa?","say":"ba-HA-sa in-do-NEH-sya-nya … A-pa","en":"What’s “…” in Indonesian?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Tentu.","say":"TEN-tu","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Betul.","say":"BEH-tul","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Kayaknya iya.","say":"KA-yak-nya EE-ya","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Serius?","say":"seh-REE-us","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Tidak apa-apa.","say":"TEE-dak A-pa A-pa","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Mantap!","say":"MAN-tap","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Di mana {x}?","say":"dee MA-na {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Saya mau {x}.","say":"SA-ya MAU {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Ada {x}?","say":"A-da {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"Minta {x}, ya.","say":"MIN-ta {x}, ya","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Saya harus {x}.","say":"SA-ya HA-rus {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Boleh saya {x}?","say":"BO-leh SA-ya {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Saya cek dulu.","say":"SA-ya chek DU-lu","en":"Let me check first.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Saya ada rapat.","say":"SA-ya A-da RA-pat","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Pedas?","say":"peh-DAS","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Tanpa bawang, ya.","say":"TAN-pa BA-wang, ya","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Apa yang enak di sini?","say":"A-pa yang EH-nak dee SEE-nee","en":"What’s good here?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Saya tidak makan daging.","say":"SA-ya TEE-dak MA-kan DA-ging","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Berapa harganya?","say":"beh-RA-pa har-GA-nya","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Lihat-lihat saja.","say":"LEE-hat LEE-hat SA-ja","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Saya ambil yang ini.","say":"SA-ya AM-bil yang EE-nee","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Bisa bayar pakai kartu?","say":"BEE-sa BA-yar PA-kai KAR-tu","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Jauh?","say":"JA-uh","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Ke bandara, ya.","say":"keh ban-DA-ra, ya","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"kiri · kanan · lurus","say":"KEE-ree · KA-nan · LU-rus","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Tolong!","say":"TO-long","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Tidak ada tisu toilet.","say":"TEE-dak A-da TEE-su TOY-let","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Saya merasa tidak enak badan.","say":"SA-ya meh-RA-sa TEE-dak EH-nak BA-dan","en":"I don’t feel well.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Tolong panggil ambulans.","say":"TO-long PANG-gil AM-bu-lans","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Senang bertemu Anda.","say":"seh-NANG ber-TEH-mu AN-da","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Dari mana?","say":"DA-ree MA-na","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Kerjanya apa?","say":"ker-JA-nya A-pa","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Enak sekali!","say":"EH-nak seh-KA-lee","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Halo.","say":"HA-lo","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Selamat pagi.","say":"seh-LA-mat PA-gee","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Apa kabar?","say":"A-pa KA-bar","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Ya. · Tidak.","say":"ya · TEE-dak","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Tolong. · Silakan.","say":"TO-long · see-LA-kan","en":"Please. (asking · offering)"},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Terima kasih.","say":"teh-REE-ma KA-see","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Maaf.","say":"ma-AF","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Sampai jumpa.","say":"SAM-pai JUM-pa","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"satu · dua · tiga","say":"SA-tu · DU-a · TEE-ga","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"empat · lima · enam","say":"EM-pat · LEE-ma · eh-NAM","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"tujuh · delapan · sembilan","say":"TU-juh · deh-LA-pan · sem-BEE-lan","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"sepuluh · dua puluh · seratus","say":"seh-PU-luh · DU-a PU-luh · seh-RA-tus","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Apelnya merah.","say":"a-PEL-nya MEH-rah","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “is” · -nya works like “the”"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Saya makan apel.","say":"SA-ya MA-kan a-PEL","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"same order as English · verbs never change"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Saya sudah makan apel.","say":"SA-ya SU-dah MA-kan a-PEL","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"sudah (already) marks the past"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Saya mau makan apel.","say":"SA-ya MAU MA-kan a-PEL","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"mau + verb = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Kamu makan apel?","say":"KA-mu MA-kan a-PEL","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"the voice goes up (or start with Apakah)"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"toilet","say":"TOY-let","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"apotek","say":"a-po-TEK","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"rumah sakit","say":"RU-mah SA-kit","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"stasiun","say":"sta-SYUN","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"bandara","say":"ban-DA-ra","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"hotel","say":"HO-tel","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"air putih","say":"A-eer PU-tee","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"kopi","say":"KO-pee","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"bon","say":"bon","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"menu","say":"MEH-nu","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"bir","say":"beer","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"yang ini","say":"yang EE-nee","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"kantong plastik","say":"KAN-tong PLAS-tik","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"rapat","say":"RA-pat","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"berkas","say":"BER-kas","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"layar","say":"LA-yar","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"pesan","say":"peh-SAN","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"besok","say":"BEH-sok","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"pergi","say":"per-GEE","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"masuk","say":"MA-suk","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"bayar","say":"BA-yar","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Alergi · mohon dibaca","ask":"Apakah makanan ini mengandung salah satu bahan ini?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Terima kasih banyak!","note":"Peanut sauce (bumbu kacang) is on satay, gado-gado and many salads.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Saya alergi berat kacang tanah. Saya tidak bisa makan kacang tanah atau minyak kacang.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Saya alergi berat makanan laut bercangkang (udang, kepiting, kerang).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Saya tidak bisa makan gluten (gandum).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Saya vegetarian. Saya tidak makan daging, ayam, atau ikan.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Saya tidak makan babi.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"TOILET · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"PRIA · WANITA","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"KELUAR · MASUK","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"DORONG · TARIK","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"PINTU DARURAT","en":"Emergency exit"}]}